license: MIT
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21675706
version: 0.1.3
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21675706
    description: Archived release of this version
abstract: >-
  Distribution-free prediction intervals for forecasting under multiple
  simultaneous distribution shifts. DRACP composes density-ratio weighting,
  localized kernel weighting, probabilistic regime-aware weighting and a
  self-tuning online significance controller in a single weighted-conformal
  calibration step, and can wrap any scikit-learn-style point forecaster.
keywords:
  - conformal prediction
  - prediction intervals
  - distribution shift
  - time series forecasting
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Dynamic Regime-Aware Conformal Prediction for Economic Forecasting under Multiple Distribution Shifts"
